      "title": "Columns Control (ratio layouts)",
      "id": "columns-control",
      "description": "Multi-column container with a selectable width ratio (50/50, 75/25, 25/75, 40/30/30, 50/25/25, 25/25/50, 25/25/25/25). Unlike the plain Columns block, each column's relative width is author-controlled via the Layout dropdown.",
